        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Baadshah, Mr. Nice Guy\n- People: Abbas-Mustan, Sammo Hung, Jackie Chan, Richard Norton\n- Topics: film inspirations, directors, cast\n\nFacts:\n- Mr. Nice Guy is a 1997 Hong Kong action film directed by Sammo Hung.\n- Sammo Hung makes a cameo in Mr. Nice Guy as an unfortunate cyclist.\n- Mr. Nice Guy stars Jackie Chan and Richard Norton.\n- Baadshah is a 1999 Indian action comedy film directed by Abbas-Mustan.\n- Baadshah translates to \"King.\"\n- Baadshah is inspired by films including Nick of Time, Rush Hour, If Looks Could Kill, Mr Nice Guy, and The Mask.",
